   12709/   1AA80 :                     ; ZONE ANIMATION PROCEDURES AND SCRIPTS
   12710/   1AA80 :                     ;
   12711/   1AA80 :                     ; Each zone gets two entries in this jump table. The first entry points to the
   12712/   1AA80 :                     ; zone's animation procedure (usually Dynamic_Null, AKA none). The second points
   12713/   1AA80 :                     ; to the zone's animation script.
   12714/   1AA80 :                     ;
   12715/   1AA80 :                     ; Seems like stage IDs were already being shifted, since listings for $07-$0F
   12716/   1AA80 :                     ; can be found, alongside HPZ's art listed from $08 (its ID in the final).
   12717/   1AA80 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   12718/   1AA80 :                     DynArtCue_Index:
