   15821/   19A4C :                     ; ZONE ANIMATION PROCEDURES AND SCRIPTS
   15822/   19A4C :                     ;
   15823/   19A4C :                     ; Each zone gets two entries in this jump table. The first entry points to the
   15824/   19A4C :                     ; zone's animation procedure (usually Dynamic_Null, AKA none). The second points
   15825/   19A4C :                     ; to the zone's animation script.
   15826/   19A4C :                     ;
   15827/   19A4C :                     ; Seems like stage IDs were already being shifted, since listings for $07-$0F
   15828/   19A4C :                     ; can be found, alongside HPZ's art listed from $08 (its ID in the final).
